    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWell located three storey terraced townhouse presented in good condition throughout and ready for immediate occupation. The property offers well laid out accommodation with 2 reception rooms and kitchen/dining to ground floor, 2 bedrooms and a bathroom to first floor and 2 bedrooms to second floor. To the rear is an enclosed yard offering ample outdoor space to relax. \n\nThe property is in a convenient and central location within a stroll of the main shopping thoroughfare, bus and rail station and all other necessary amenities and facilities. All major routes including the N25 and N11/M11 are easily accessible.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a townhouse in a premium location and would make an ideal first time buy or investment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 9.07 x 2.7\nTiled floor, door to rear\n\nLiving Room - 3.91 x 3.64\nFireplace, timber floor\n\nSitting Room - 3.36 x 2.71\nFireplace, timber floor\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.21 x 3.18\nFitted Kitchen, tiled floor\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBathroom - 4.37 x 3.15\nBath, w.c., w.h.b., shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.55 x 2.76\nCarpet\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.48 x 3.77\nCarpet\n\nSecond floor - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.52 x 3.14\nCarpet\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.43 x 3.79\nCarpet\n\nOutside - \nEnclosed South facing rear yard\n\nServices - \nAll mains services and oil fired central heating.\n\n"
      },
